cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproducibility bundle, please cite the paper below."
title: "The Camera, the Split, and the Label: A Three-Check Audit of Glaucoma-Progression Prediction"
abstract: >-
  An audit of the entire published deep-learning record on the public GRAPE glaucoma-progression benchmark.
  Under three checks (a device-only baseline, a patient-grouped split, and a test that the input is disjoint
  from the window that defines the label), none of the reported numbers can be distinguished, at this sample
  size, from a trivial baseline.
authors:
  - name: "Ufonia Science Team"
year: 2026
# The paper is under anonymous review at the NeurIPS 2026 workshop TAE ("Can We Trust AI Evaluation?").
